WEBVTT

00:02:58.266 --> 00:03:02.383
more regulations, less resources.

00:03:02.383 --> 00:03:06.582
But now, three years later, here's where we stand.

00:03:06.582 --> 00:03:11.000
It's a vibrant, global community of hackerspaces,

00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:12.902
and this is just the beginning.

00:03:12.902 --> 00:03:14.963
These are some of the biggest ones,

00:03:14.963 --> 00:03:17.027
and there are others opening every day.

00:03:17.027 --> 00:03:19.898
There's one probably going to open up in Moscow,

00:03:19.898 --> 00:03:21.197
one in South Korea,

00:03:21.197 --> 00:03:23.523
and the cool thing is they each have their own

00:03:23.523 --> 00:03:25.306
individual flavor

00:03:25.306 --> 00:03:27.630
that grew out of the community they came out of.

00:03:27.630 --> 00:03:30.769
Let me take you on a little tour.